<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 54,960.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 54,960.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Sept 24 totaled 54,960 bales, up from 54,548 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 496 bales issued, 12,972 decertification orders, 84 cancellations, and 1,482 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
